. Find the value of $a+b+c.$\n\n|  |  | To: |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | **A** | **B** | **C** |\n| From: | **A** | $1$ | $a$ | $0$ |\n| **B** | $0$ | $b$ | $2$ |  |\n| **C** | $c$ | $1$ | $0$ |  |" :question/worked-solution "Let's examine our diagram.\n\n- There is $1$ arrow starting at Station A and ending at Station B. So, there is only one route from $A$ to $B,$ and so $a=1.$\n\n- There is $1$ arrow starting at Station B and ending at Station B. So, there is only one route from $B$ to $B,$ and so $b=1.$\n\n- There are no arrows starting at Station C and ending at Station A. So, there are no routes from $C$ to $A,$ and so $c=0.$\n\nAs a result, our route matrix is the following:\n\n|  |  | To: |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | **A** | **B** | **C** |\n| From: | **A** | $1$ | $1$ | $0$ |\n| **B** | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ |  |\n| **C** | $0$ | $1$ | $0$ |  |\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\na+b+c=1+1+0=2.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-139689/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "10ca3efc-7d23-5bc1-ab41-f785bed69986"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-139689"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-319412/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "879d5f98-e2cd-5c55-9a2c-affdb75a00d7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-319412/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "61ca7496-b260-5fd4-b335-2db2dad197aa" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-319412/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer-field/choices ["q-319412/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-319412/field-2/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "4f97e0ec-eeac-5bed-b